  ('a975739f-9a90-5ed8-a016-aafb5c024198', '49006ee7-0db1-5693-a80a-aad669125b6b', 17, 'Lindqvist''s Theory', 'In which Dr Lindqvist believes the creature is not hunting but learning. It imitates the station''s rhythms because it is trying to communicate.

The station''s hull groaned under the weight of the trench, a long low sound like a ship settling at anchor.

Down here, Rhea thought, the dark wasn''t an absence. It was a presence that hadn''t introduced itself yet.

