  ('4ae49472-24d0-5651-a5e9-9bd268478b73', '49006ee7-0db1-5693-a80a-aad669125b6b', 18, 'Oxygen', 'In which a scrubber fails and oxygen begins to run low. The crew has seven days left, and no way to the surface.

