  ('3afeb693-e698-5cb3-ab2a-a7c80ce7026e', '49006ee7-0db1-5693-a80a-aad669125b6b', 23, 'What It Wants', 'In which the creature does not want the crew. It wants the mining to stop. The drones have been tearing up its nursery.

