  ('a967cdae-b514-54a9-a32e-045fcc5733ba', '49af270f-d457-5324-a474-492be457e16f', 17, 'Imogen''s Fear', 'In which in private, Imogen confesses she wants out of the Society but can''t leave: members who leave lose their places, scholarships and futures.

