  ('a0fc7a0b-1eb0-533b-a864-6c603b1160df', 'af2bf517-2e7b-545b-a05f-12ccab8d958d', 28, 'Restored', 'In which Adaeze''s mother is restored as a master weaver. The guild offers Adaeze a full apprenticeship, under her own name.

