  ('cc07a362-bc53-5830-a68b-a58a5f7c50ae', 'af2bf517-2e7b-545b-a05f-12ccab8d958d', 29, 'Mama Nkechi''s Reward', 'In which The king offers Mama Nkechi any reward. She asks for a permanent stall at the palace gate, for onions.

