  ('aa9ac031-fbde-51e8-a8b3-03b01d781fa7', 'af2bf517-2e7b-545b-a05f-12ccab8d958d', 30, 'The First Cloth', 'In which Adaeze weaves her first official guild cloth. It remembers her mother''s return, and it never stops singing.

