values ('e494bd08-63c6-55cd-aa8a-a20933c60adb', '81da30f6-c2a1-5fdd-a854-7537bb7df7f3', 'Night Market', 'night-market', 'Every night from midnight to four, a market opens in the car park behind Mercado Central that only some people can see. You can buy a forgotten memory, a bottled thunderstorm or a second chance, if you can pay the price. Detective Lucía Ferrer can see it. She has never told anyone. Now a stallholder is dead, and the market wants her to find out why.', 'ongoing', 'teen', now() - interval '4.94 days')
