  ('e715c297-5df6-52dd-afe0-45ff6e9e5660', 'e494bd08-63c6-55cd-aa8a-a20933c60adb', 24, 'Bram''s Answer', 'In which Bram owes Lucía one answer. She asks what her grandmother bought here once. Bram tells her: the right to forget the market. Lucía''s mother.

