  ('02915243-357d-541e-a8d0-d6ce4d0d7c07', 'e494bd08-63c6-55cd-aa8a-a20933c60adb', 26, '12:00 Again', 'In which lucía goes back to the Night Market the next night, as a regular, with Calvo, and buys a churro. It costs one good joke.

