  ('82937c86-b111-57c8-ad8e-cee9e6860992', '054b855b-86c2-50d2-a240-01ecd72ce88f', 21, 'Old Mr Lindgren''s Toast', 'In which at the supper, Old Mr Lindgren raises a glass to Chioma''s father, and the two families finally grieve him together.

